     1635   reposition br-docs to recid rr no-error.
     1636   OPEN QUERY br-nakl FOR EACH buf_add-trn WHERE                   buf_add-trn.doc-code = buf_add-doc.doc-code NO-LOCK,              EACH buf_trn-doc  where                  buf_trn-doc.doc-code =  buf_add-trn.trn-doc-code NO-LOCK.
     1637   END.
